1
00:00:12,264 --> 00:00:18,812
Cette année, tu as changé de ville et de travail. Comment tu te sens ?
This year, you changed city and job. How do you feel?

2
00:00:18,912 --> 00:00:26,396
Bien ! L'année dernière, j'habitais à Paris et je ne connaissais personne ici.
Good! Last year, I lived in Paris and I didn't know anyone here.

3
00:00:26,496 --> 00:00:31,964
Maintenant, tu as un appartement, des collègues et un groupe d'amis.
Now you have a flat, colleagues and a group of friends.

4
00:00:32,064 --> 00:00:37,628
Oui, et je parle français avec beaucoup plus de confiance qu'avant.
Yes, and I speak French with much more confidence than before.

5
00:00:37,728 --> 00:00:45,644
L'année prochaine, tu vas ouvrir ton agence ? Si tu y arrives, tu seras très fière.
Next year, are you going to open your agency? If you do it, you'll be very proud.

6
00:00:45,744 --> 00:00:54,596
Je l'espère. Et toi, tu partiras voyager ? Bravo pour tout ce que tu as appris !
I hope so. And you, will you go travelling? Well done for everything you've learned!
